"- Keys are JSON-like arrays: finite numbers, strings, booleans, null, arrays, and plain objects. Object property order does not matter; array order does. Undefined, functions, symbols, dates, cycles, and non-finite numbers are rejected. Keys are identifiers, not arbitrary objects.\n"
"- `initial` is creation-only. A later caller with the same key does not reset a shared model. Define an explicit action for updates."

