"- Declaration creates no observer. A read may create an observer and query-cache entry but does not subscribe or fetch. First mounted projection subscribes; sibling projections share it. Last unsubscribe removes the observer from the query; query-core owns cancellation and cache gcTime. Remount rebinds before subscribing, including after the query-cache entry expires.\n"
