#: docs/reference/sum.md
msgid "Add numeric atom values. For example, calculate an order total from goods and delivery charges."
msgstr "Add numeric atom values. For example, calculate an order total from goods and delivery charges."

#. Markdown. Preserve links, inline code and table/list syntax.
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: docs/reference/sum.md
msgid "Reads every numeric input. Also accepts one numeric atom or an atom of readonly number[]. Empty input returns 0. Uses ordinary JavaScript addition, with its floating-point precision; represent money in minor units. Strings and promises are rejected by TypeScript."
msgstr "Reads every numeric input. Also accepts one numeric atom or an atom of readonly number[]. Empty input returns 0. Uses ordinary JavaScript addition, with its floating-point precision; represent money in minor units. Strings and promises are rejected by TypeScript."
